{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:58:08.390569Z","id":"cbbd74aacfcaae0de97c5cb5b04019ae031382c528ea61f438013e7cfe1889f9","body":{"detail":"sizes here are the gallery and artifact entries, the eager bridge, the bridge's parts, the question module and the extension. The shell's host chunk (dist/_clax/shell/host-*.js, imported by web/shell/src/artifact-main.ts on ?app=1; 3677 gzip bytes at 4928617e) loads before the host's first `ready`, which stops the app's say-usable timer, yet it can grow without any budget in web/perf/bundle-budget.json failing.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":98},"end":{"line":98},"content_hash":"2de1cdb0a07568b315cc7144cf3b6d9d31094e0681341ea26845036d4f5cfce4"},"suggested_fix":"Measure the chunk artifact-main.ts imports for app mode (its manifest dynamic import) as `host`, and add a `host` entry to web/perf/bundle-budget.json at its size rounded up to 64 bytes.","summary":"App mode's lazy host chunk, on the say-usable path, has no bundle budget","tags":["review","budget","perf","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
